2/hangman-manager","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/hangman-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This programs keeps track of the state of a game of hangman. Unlike the usual hangman game, this program keeps updating a wide selection of words with the same pattern based on what the user has guessed. It delays picking a word until it is forced to.","topics":[],"score":220972,"global_rank":203437},{"name":"yjia757-2/assassin-manager","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/assassin-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This programs manages a game of assassin by controling a kill-ring, or a list of alive player(s); and a graveyard, or a list of player(s) who were killed. Once the player in the kill-ring was killed by the person who was stalking him/her, the program will remove this player from the kill-ring to the graveyard. ","topics":[],"score":220972,"global_rank":203438},{"name":"yjia757-2/guitar-string","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/guitar-string","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This program will give practice with queues, interfaces, objects, and arrays of objects. You are going to implement two classes that allow us to simulate a guitar. ","topics":[],"score":220972,"global_rank":203439},{"name":"yjia757-2/letter-inventory","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/letter-inventory","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This programs keeps tracking the count of each letter for the given string.","topics":[],"score":220972,"global_rank":203440},{"name":"roshanadhikari2073/javaprogrammingchallenges-techrise","owner":"roshanadhikari2073","html_url":"https://github.com/roshanadhikari2073/javaprogrammingchallenges-techrise","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","descr